# ==============================================================================
# CRITICAL SECURITY WARNING
# ==============================================================================
# NEVER commit terraform.tfstate or terraform.tfstate.backup to version control.
# These files contain sensitive information, including resource IDs and sometimes
# plaintext secrets or credentials. Always store state remotely (e.g., GCS bucket).
# ==============================================================================

